        <item>
            <title>5.85</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 13:29:44 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>430</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>5.85</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.85</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Scrolling stays smooth while a cloud project syncs.</b> Every card used to walk the project folders on disk to build its context menu, once per redraw, and every arriving file redrew the whole gallery. Folder lists are cached now and arrivals are announced less often.</li>
<li><b>Dragging a multi-selection moves every selected asset.</b> A drag onto another folder could move a single asset and leave the rest behind.</li>
<li><b>Renaming a folder during a sync no longer duplicates it.</b> A download that started before the rename now notices that the asset has moved instead of fetching it into the folder that no longer exists.</li>
<li><b>Generating with Command Return says why it stopped.</b> When a draft failed its checks, nothing happened at all.</li>
<li><b>Reference limits follow the model.</b> The Resolve bridge stopped at three video references even for models that accept ten.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
