        <item>
            <title>5.84</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 13:29:41 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>425</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>5.84</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.84</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Cancel a running CRAFTR operation.</b> The spinner now carries a small x. One click stops the operation immediately and leaves the editor unchanged.</li>
<li><b>Drop an image on the prompt editor.</b> A bar appears with two actions: Image prompt writes a complete prompt that recreates the image, Apply style takes only lighting, colour, camera and mood and applies them to the existing prompt.</li>
<li><b>Multi-selection drag to the Finder.</b> Dragging several selected assets into the Finder now copies every file instead of creating a text file.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
